    description: "SOURCE: Process health synthesis 4.2, recommendation 3. Before re-running hypergumbo analysis on a repo, check whether any hypergumbo source code changed since the last run for that repo. The bakeoff-features init idempotency fix (e11a15ea) prevents redundant session initialization but not redundant analysis within a session. Some repo-cohort combinations show identical metrics (iceberg C7 vs C8, forgejo C8 vs C9), each generating ~100MB of artifacts. Implementation: store a hash of relevant hypergumbo source files in each output directory; skip analysis if hash matches; flag skipped repos in the cohort report."  # d2f9
